WEBVTT

01:38.540 --> 01:39.510
What's going on?

01:44.070 --> 01:46.450
His momentum and drive are just gone.

01:47.090 --> 01:48.580
His punches aren't direct.

01:54.690 --> 01:57.470
You're not giving this your all.

01:59.880 --> 02:00.980
What? You think I'm…

02:00.980 --> 02:04.620
You're not trying to hit me,
and not dodging my kicks.

02:05.780 --> 02:07.120
I picked this fight…

02:07.950 --> 02:10.270
thinking I knew everything I needed to.

02:11.230 --> 02:12.320
But I was wrong.

02:13.340 --> 02:15.720
So, why did he hit them?

02:17.240 --> 02:18.280
I wanna know.

02:19.760 --> 02:20.870
What's his deal?

02:23.530 --> 02:26.460
What do you want here?

02:31.540 --> 02:33.290
For real…

02:35.040 --> 02:37.170
What do I want here?

02:38.310 --> 02:40.030
Why did you hit them?

02:40.720 --> 02:43.580
Doesn't being strong mean
your guys can do whatever?

02:45.870 --> 02:47.090
It does.

02:47.950 --> 02:50.290
This is a home for the strong.

02:56.450 --> 02:58.430
It's not a home for scum.

03:08.220 --> 03:12.640
Lions can't function properly
if they can't think straight.

03:14.120 --> 03:18.400
I'd had to take the jumpers off more
and more scum as time went on…

03:20.470 --> 03:21.580
But then…

03:23.190 --> 03:25.980
I had an encounter with
Choji's obsession, Bofurin.

03:34.320 --> 03:38.610
I thought this might be the spark
to cause some kind of change…

03:40.720 --> 03:45.490
and I dragged everyone
into a totally unjustified fight.

03:49.230 --> 03:50.400
But even so…

03:51.010 --> 03:52.740
I can't turn back now.

03:54.300 --> 03:55.150
That day…

03:56.080 --> 03:58.390
I decided to carry on his mistake.

03:59.920 --> 04:02.750
And now… I can't stop.

04:21.710 --> 04:23.880
This mark is fading.

04:26.610 --> 04:29.530
What do you want here?

04:31.570 --> 04:33.070
Let me think.

04:53.830 --> 04:55.610
I want to go to the mountains.

04:56.550 --> 04:57.310
Huh?

04:57.890 --> 04:59.330
Quit daydreaming.

05:00.620 --> 05:02.890
You said this isn't a home for scum.

05:03.400 --> 05:05.300
Then what are you doing here?

05:06.290 --> 05:07.980
Quit spouting crap.

05:08.720 --> 05:11.220
You've done shit just as scummy.

05:12.480 --> 05:14.250
Sure, you're strong.

05:16.510 --> 05:17.850
But you're so damn lame.

05:19.020 --> 05:23.040
And I'll beat you so you
can see just how true that is!

05:24.200 --> 05:26.590
And then you have to stop being lame,

05:27.790 --> 05:31.580
and start being cool enough
that I'll want to fight you!

05:35.540 --> 05:37.780
You're awfully selfish.

05:38.120 --> 05:42.300
And that's some big talk to give
someone much more skilled than you.

05:42.660 --> 05:44.650
I don't care if it's selfish!

05:46.380 --> 05:50.370
That's what fighting
to settle a score is all about!

05:52.310 --> 05:55.380
No matter how strong my opponent is,

05:55.990 --> 05:57.750
even if I owe them my life,

05:58.190 --> 05:59.610
I don't look away,

06:01.240 --> 06:03.610
and I don't change!

06:06.830 --> 06:08.330
Why do you think that?

06:08.810 --> 06:10.340
That won't make us…

06:10.340 --> 06:11.720
I'm the leader here.

06:12.530 --> 06:14.390
I'm the strongest.

06:15.180 --> 06:16.300
I'm free.

06:17.310 --> 06:18.810
I won't give in to anyone.

06:19.530 --> 06:20.800
I make the rules.

06:22.820 --> 06:24.830
If you don't get that, get out.

06:39.130 --> 06:42.060
[Ori]

07:03.600 --> 07:04.530
Got it…

07:06.720 --> 07:07.400
But…

07:08.050 --> 07:11.590
I'll tell everyone what you're thinking.

07:12.730 --> 07:14.530
And I'll take the jumpers.

07:17.520 --> 07:19.070
So please, Choji,

07:20.120 --> 07:21.810
keep laughing with them.

07:38.340 --> 07:40.820
You really are…

07:41.410 --> 07:44.040
good at pissing people off.

07:50.190 --> 07:51.280
I knew it…

07:52.260 --> 07:55.190
You really weren't giving it your all.

07:56.110 --> 07:57.710
Isn't that right, Shaggy?

07:59.730 --> 08:01.460
I'm not Shaggy.

08:06.620 --> 08:09.700
The name's Togame. Togame Jo.

08:13.340 --> 08:14.430
And fine.

08:19.790 --> 08:20.980
I'll give all I got,

08:22.800 --> 08:23.630
Sakura.

08:59.070 --> 09:00.900
Wh-What's going on?

09:00.960 --> 09:02.310
Th-They're…

09:02.950 --> 09:04.180
smiling.

09:49.300 --> 09:53.290
Sakura… You're incredible!

09:55.870 --> 09:58.410
I don't really know why…

09:58.960 --> 10:01.480
but I'm feeling super moved right now!

10:02.030 --> 10:05.590
I didn't know Sakura was this good…

10:06.010 --> 10:07.160
Right?

10:23.320 --> 10:24.640
Dammit…

10:25.410 --> 10:26.530
What the hell?

10:28.650 --> 10:32.300
I'm fighting a guy who did some real lame crap,

10:34.520 --> 10:36.700
so why does it feel so good?

10:38.320 --> 10:39.440
And…

10:40.810 --> 10:43.100
I've never had someone I was fighting…

10:43.660 --> 10:44.960
I'll give all I got,

10:45.340 --> 10:46.120
Sakura.

10:47.670 --> 10:50.090
…call me by name like that before.

10:55.560 --> 10:56.820
Damn, man.

10:57.720 --> 11:00.330
It's annoying how happy you look.

11:04.250 --> 11:06.550
And your movements keep getting smoother.

11:09.140 --> 11:10.680
Come at me!

11:50.420 --> 11:51.930
Who knew…

11:52.670 --> 11:55.080
fighting could feel this good?

11:56.780 --> 11:59.820
You said it. I never knew.

12:02.830 --> 12:05.400
We've gone on long enough.

12:07.480 --> 12:08.970
How about we finish it?

12:10.000 --> 12:11.000
Yeah.

12:19.180 --> 12:20.830
- It's been fun…
- It's been fun…

12:22.130 --> 12:23.080
Togame.

12:24.540 --> 12:25.530
Sakura.

12:35.820 --> 12:36.720
Ah…

12:37.550 --> 12:38.810
I see…

12:39.960 --> 12:43.400
No matter how strong my opponent is,

12:43.610 --> 12:45.270
even if I owe them my life,

12:45.620 --> 12:47.220
I don't look away,

12:48.630 --> 12:51.130
and I don't change!

12:52.390 --> 12:53.630
That day…

12:58.440 --> 13:00.580
I should have done this.

13:03.470 --> 13:05.480
But I looked away.

13:07.050 --> 13:08.450
I didn't face him.

13:10.260 --> 13:12.280
I didn't assert myself.

13:13.540 --> 13:17.620
You're probably going to get
even stronger than you are now.

13:19.060 --> 13:23.140
You're not afraid to assert yourself to anyone.

13:25.940 --> 13:27.510
Never change.

13:32.330 --> 13:33.280
Thank you…

13:37.190 --> 13:38.150
Sakura.

13:42.620 --> 13:44.490
I finally get it.

13:51.920 --> 13:53.880
I'm down for the count.

13:56.710 --> 13:58.080
I give up.

14:12.180 --> 14:13.620
Wait, what did he say?

14:13.620 --> 14:14.580
He gives up?!

14:14.720 --> 14:16.030
No way, dude!

14:16.290 --> 14:19.290
He'd rush into hell with a smile!

14:19.590 --> 14:21.200
We musta misheard, right?

14:21.470 --> 14:22.250
Yeah…

14:24.330 --> 14:26.300
S-Sakura!

14:33.880 --> 14:35.090
Screw you!

14:36.750 --> 14:38.370
The hell was that?!

14:39.370 --> 14:41.080
What do you mean, you give up?!

14:42.060 --> 14:43.730
Why'd you just let me win?!

14:43.730 --> 14:46.820
Okay, that's it! Nice work!

14:47.570 --> 14:50.680
You sure are strong! Fight me sometime!

14:51.180 --> 14:53.680
Alright, Ume, come on!

14:53.870 --> 14:55.720
- Hey, wait! We're not done yet!
- It's finally our turn!

14:55.720 --> 14:56.490
- Choji…
- It's finally our turn!

14:56.690 --> 14:58.500
- Let's stop this.
- Hurry up, hurry up!

14:59.080 --> 15:02.900
- We're in the wrong here.
- Come on, Ume! Get up here!

15:03.000 --> 15:04.290
Come on, man!

15:04.350 --> 15:06.390
- We…
- It'll be so fun! Right?!

15:06.520 --> 15:08.170
- I messed up.
- Hurry on up!

15:08.550 --> 15:10.330
- Come ooon!
- Choji…

15:10.550 --> 15:12.150
Let's go already!

15:21.820 --> 15:23.950
Shut up, man.

15:24.610 --> 15:26.590
You lost, so shut your mouth.

15:36.380 --> 15:37.170
Sakura,

15:37.930 --> 15:38.930
tag out.

15:44.960 --> 15:48.240
Good for you. You had a real conversation.

15:49.680 --> 15:51.470
What you tried just now…

15:52.010 --> 15:53.720
is real proof of that.

15:57.390 --> 15:58.520
And you, Togame!

15:58.780 --> 16:00.710
Can I leave the follow-up to you?

16:01.970 --> 16:02.700
Please.

16:09.380 --> 16:11.710
You're a real meddler.

16:19.660 --> 16:21.120
Don't die on me.

16:27.890 --> 16:29.170
If you lose,

16:30.350 --> 16:31.450
I'll kick your ass.

16:32.790 --> 16:33.470
Yup.

16:35.380 --> 16:37.490
Why am I so pissed off?

16:39.720 --> 16:42.240
I thought I was used to guys getting beat…

16:44.480 --> 16:45.800
So why…?

16:46.940 --> 16:50.420
Good for you. You had a real conversation.

16:51.090 --> 16:52.310
I don't get it.

16:53.320 --> 16:55.720
His punches didn't say a thing.

16:57.400 --> 16:58.300
Sakura!

17:03.080 --> 17:04.300
Welcome back.

17:05.130 --> 17:06.830
Crying again, Nire?

17:07.310 --> 17:10.170
You were amazing! I was so moved!

17:10.230 --> 17:10.990
Sakura.

17:12.420 --> 17:14.330
You may not have liked it,

17:14.880 --> 17:17.190
having Togame dictate the ending,

17:18.760 --> 17:20.150
but even ignoring that,

17:21.530 --> 17:23.810
you did real good.

17:29.660 --> 17:31.520
Alright, Ume!

17:32.360 --> 17:34.190
We finally get to fight!

17:36.560 --> 17:38.530
I want to ask you something first.

17:39.500 --> 17:42.740
Did watching that last fight
make you feel anything?

17:42.950 --> 17:44.390
Huh? No, why?

17:47.980 --> 17:49.210
I see…

17:51.930 --> 17:53.120
That's too bad.

18:09.330 --> 18:10.310
Too bad?

18:12.400 --> 18:13.230
Why?

18:18.580 --> 18:19.800
Well, whatever!

18:19.990 --> 18:23.710
That doesn't matter! You're being unfair!

18:24.310 --> 18:27.170
Bofurin has so many strong guys!

18:28.330 --> 18:30.330
Unlike us.

18:31.040 --> 18:32.850
Everyone's so weak,

18:33.100 --> 18:34.990
I can't be free.

18:36.200 --> 18:37.470
It's no fun!

18:40.210 --> 18:41.580
The hell?

18:42.190 --> 18:45.100
Is that what Tomiyama thinks of us…?

18:45.660 --> 18:47.340
But if I win,

18:47.850 --> 18:48.940
then you,

18:49.390 --> 18:50.360
and Furin,

18:51.100 --> 18:54.370
will aaaaaaall be mine!

18:55.810 --> 18:57.980
You're top dog at Furin!

18:58.570 --> 19:01.340
Stronger and freer than anyone else there!

19:01.520 --> 19:03.820
You always look like you have so much fun.

19:04.840 --> 19:08.130
If I can prove I'm stronger than you,

19:08.470 --> 19:10.570
and take Furin for myself,

19:11.150 --> 19:15.510
then this time for sure I'll be free,
and have more fun than anyone!

19:16.930 --> 19:18.410
Finally…

19:19.630 --> 19:20.910
Finally!

19:24.130 --> 19:27.560
I can finally end this nonstop boredom!

19:31.950 --> 19:33.860
Now, Ume…

19:34.560 --> 19:35.890
I want it…

19:37.340 --> 19:39.640
Give it to me!

20:13.120 --> 20:16.390
I've never seen such wild movements…

20:16.740 --> 20:18.420
He's a natural monster.

20:18.920 --> 20:23.710
That's how he became
Lion's Head's youngest-ever leader.

20:24.890 --> 20:25.610
Dammit.

20:26.230 --> 20:27.170
Dammit!

20:28.850 --> 20:30.890
If he hadn't stopped me then…

20:36.430 --> 20:39.770
I'd have been worse off than him! Dammit!

20:41.150 --> 20:43.000
I'll get stronger! You'll see!

20:45.510 --> 20:48.220
Stronger… Stronger!

21:05.910 --> 21:07.160
Hey, Tomiyama.

21:07.230 --> 21:08.710
What's up, Ume?

21:09.650 --> 21:13.320
Things don't get easier if you
focus on the shoulda, woulda, coulda.

21:16.480 --> 21:19.360
It must have been rough, Tomiyama.

21:21.440 --> 21:23.810
I. Told. You.

21:24.800 --> 21:27.070
The things you say…

21:27.950 --> 21:30.210
don't make any sense!

21:38.920 --> 21:39.800
I see…

21:40.880 --> 21:42.350
You don't understand?

21:46.760 --> 21:49.000
If you really don't get that,

21:50.800 --> 21:52.500
then there's a 100% chance…

21:55.050 --> 21:56.050
I'll win.

21:57.000 --> 22:00.010
[#08: Inherited Feelings]

23:30.390 --> 23:33.600
Tomiyama's acrobatic movements sure were amazing!

23:33.710 --> 23:36.620
Hmph. E-Even I could do that.

23:36.650 --> 23:39.420
Really?! That's incredible! I wanna see!

23:39.520 --> 23:40.040
Huh?!

23:40.180 --> 23:41.620
Y-You mean right now?!

23:41.620 --> 23:42.240
Right now!

23:44.910 --> 23:46.410
What, you can't?

23:46.470 --> 23:47.160
No, I…!

23:47.460 --> 23:50.280
Fine! I'll do it!

23:50.280 --> 23:51.700
- Ooh! Yes!
- Here goes!

23:51.870 --> 23:53.010
- Three!
- Three…

23:53.070 --> 23:53.960
Two!

23:54.240 --> 23:55.510
- One!
- W-Wait a sec!

23:55.570 --> 23:55.880
Eh?

23:56.160 --> 23:57.850
I-I'll go when I'm ready!

23:57.970 --> 23:58.890
Ready, and…
